<opsproc code="00009070.0001001" revdate="2018-05-17T09:58:56"><title><abb>SEC</abb> 2</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.017"><title>During cockpit preparation</title><procdesc code="00009070.0001001.058" lid="N.00009070.0001001.115"><note code="00009070.0001001.059" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.116"><unlist bulltype="NDASH" code="00009070.0001001.060" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.117"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.118">If the Yellow Electric Pump
is not available:</para><item layer="1"><unlist bulltype="BULLET" code="00009070.0001001.061" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.119"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.120">Pressurize the Yellow Hydraulic
System with:</para><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.121">A Ground cart,
or with</para></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.122">Both Yellow
and Green Engine Hydraulic Pumps with both Engines running.</para></item></unlist></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.123">Replace any
action on the <tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ELEC PUMP</tech-label> by a similar action
on the Ground Cart or on both <tech-label type="pb-sw">GREEN ENG 1 PUMP</tech-label> and <tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ENG 2 PUMP</tech-label> in the following procedure.</para></item></unlist></note></procdesc><procbody lid="N.00009070.0001001.018"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.019"><noteproc code="00009070.0001001.008" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.020"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.021">After application of the maintenance
procedure, the <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>C/B</ecamsys><ecamtitle>TRIPPED REAR PNL N-R</ecamtitle></ecam-data> alert is displayed on the <abb>EWD</abb>.</para></noteproc></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.022"><para code="00009070.0001001.009" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.023"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Check of
the elevator control and roll spoilers control through the operative
computers:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009070.0001001.024"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.025"><para code="00009070.0001001.010" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.026"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Put the aircraft in the test configuration:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009070.0001001.027"><action-block lid="N.00009070.0001001.028"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.029" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.011"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ELEC PUMP</tech-label></challenge><response>ON</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.030" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.012"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">PTU</tech-label></challenge><response>AUTO</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.031" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.013"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE ELEC PUMP</tech-label></challenge><response>AUTO</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.032" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.014"><challenge><tech-label type="pb">BLUE PUMP OVRD</tech-label></challenge><response>ON</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.033" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.015"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 1</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.034" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.016"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.035" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.017"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">SEC 1</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.036" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.018"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">SEC 3</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.037" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.019"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.038">Wait <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">5</measure></para></command></action></action-block></relevant-sub-proc><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.039"><para code="00009070.0001001.020" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.040"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Check of
the elevator control through the ELAC 1:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009070.0001001.041"><action-block lid="N.00009070.0001001.042"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.043" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.021"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE PUMP OVRD</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.044" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.022"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.045">Wait for hydraulic circuit depressurization.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.046" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.023"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.047">On the <tech-label type="s-page">F/CTL</tech-label>, check that blue elevator actuator symbol becomes amber.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.048" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.024"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.049">Wait <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">5</measure></para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.050" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.025"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE PUMP OVRD</tech-label></challenge><response>ON</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.051" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.026"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.052" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.027"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">SEC 1</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.053" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.028"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.054">Move the <abb>CAPT</abb> stick
from forward stop to aft stop.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.055" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.029"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.056">On the <tech-label type="s-page">F/CTL</tech-label>, check the full travel of both elevators.</para></command></action></action-block><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.057"><cautionproc code="00009070.0001001.030" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.058"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.059">If an expected elevator
movement does not occur, do not attempt any reset.</para><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.060">Contact the maintenance.</para></cautionproc></inform></relevant-sub-proc><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.061"><para code="00009070.0001001.031" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.062"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Check of
the elevator control through the SEC 1:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009070.0001001.063"><action-block lid="N.00009070.0001001.064"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.065" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.032"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.066" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.033"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">SEC 1</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.067" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.034"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.068">Wait <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">5</measure></para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.069" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.035"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE PUMP OVRD</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.070" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.036"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.071">Wait for hydraulic circuits
depressurization.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.072" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.037"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.073">On the <tech-label type="s-page">F/CTL</tech-label>, check that the blue elevator actuator symbols becomes amber.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.074" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.038"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.075">Wait <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">5</measure></para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.076" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.039"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE PUMP OVRD</tech-label></challenge><response>ON</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.077" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.040"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 1</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.078" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.041"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.079" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.042"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.080">Move the <abb>CAPT</abb> stick
from right stop to left stop, then from forward stop to aft stop.</para></command><comment code="00009070.0001001.043"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.081">Each stop must be
applied during <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">3</measure></para></comment></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.082" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.044"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.083">On the <tech-label type="s-page">F/CTL</tech-label>, check the correct movement of the pairs of spoilers 2, 3, and 4
and the full travel of both elevators.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.084" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.045"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.085">Move the <abb>F/O</abb> stick
from right stop to left stop, then from forward stop to aft stop.</para></command><comment code="00009070.0001001.046"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.086">Each stop must be
applied during <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="s">3</measure></para></comment></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.087" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.047"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.088">On the <tech-label type="s-page">F/CTL</tech-label>, check the correct movement of the pairs of spoilers 2, 3, and 4
and the full travel of both elevators.</para></command></action></action-block><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.089"><cautionproc code="00009070.0001001.048" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.090"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.091">If an expected spoiler
or elevator movement does not occur, do not attempt any reset.</para><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.092">Contact the maintenance.</para></cautionproc></inform></relevant-sub-proc><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.093"><para code="00009070.0001001.049" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.094"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Return to
normal configuration:</emph></para></inform><relevant-sub-proc lid="N.00009070.0001001.095"><action-block lid="N.00009070.0001001.096"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.097" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.050"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ELEC PUMP</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.098" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.051"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">BLUE PUMP OVRD</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.099" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.052"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 1</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.100" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.053"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ELAC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.124" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009070.0001001.062"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">SEC 2</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action></action-block></relevant-sub-proc></relevant-sub-proc></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.109"><title>After engine start</title><procbody lid="N.00009070.0001001.110"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.111"><noteproc code="00009070.0001001.057" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.112"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.114"> The <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>F/CTL</ecamsys><ecamtitle>ELEV SERVO
FAULT</ecamtitle></ecam-data> alert may be displayed on the <abb>EWD</abb> if the <abb>PTU</abb> is inhibited and only one engine is operating.
This alert must disappear when the <abb>PTU</abb> or the second engine
is started.</para></noteproc></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.004"><title>In flight</title><procbody lid="N.00009070.0001001.005"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00009070.0001001.003" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.008" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If the <abb>SEC</abb> 1 and the <abb>SEC</abb> 3 fail during
the flight:</intro><procbody lid="N.00009070.0001001.009"><limit layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.010"><lit-limit lid="N.00009070.0001001.011">Autoland
is not permitted.</lit-limit></limit><limit layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.012"><lit-limit lid="N.00009070.0001001.013">Maximum
landing capability is CAT 1</lit-limit></limit><action layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.014" memory="false"><command code="00009070.0001001.006"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.015">Disengage the <abb>AP</abb> at <measure category="Altitude" show-unit="true" system="US" unit="ft">500</measure> <abb>RA</abb> before landing in direct law.</para></command><comment code="00009070.0001001.007"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009070.0001001.016">When the <abb>AP</abb> is disengaged with the three <abb>SEC</abb>s failed, it cannot be
engaged again.</para></comment></action></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>